{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10","index":10,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lù","traditional":"路","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"问","pinyin":"wèn","traditional":"問","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Zilu (Zi Lu - Cu Lo) bertanya hal keperwiraan."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"nán","traditional":"南","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"běi","traditional":"北","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"抑","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"？"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Keperwiraan dari daerah Selatankah, keperwiraan dari daerah Utarakah, atau keperwiraan sejati?","editorial_annotations":[{"id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.02.note.yu-pronunciation","kind":"interpretive_comparison","after_paragraph_index":0,"anchor_hanzi":"南方之強與，北方之強與，抑而強與","title_indonesian":"Catatan pinyin 與 (yú) — partikel tanya","attribution":"Kamus Kementerian Pendidikan Taiwan; Zhu Xi