"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jū","traditional":"居","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Dengan lemah lembut mendidik sesama, tidak membalas perbuatan yang ingkar dari Jalan Suci; itulah keperwiraan dari Selatan yang juga dipegang teguh oleh seorang Junzi - Kuncu. (S.S. XII:16)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"rèn","traditional":"衽","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jīn","traditional":"金","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gé","traditional":"革","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"sǐ","traditional":"死","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"厌","pinyin":"yàn","traditional":"厭","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"běi","traditional":"北","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jū","traditional":"居","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Rebah dengan tetap mengenakan pakaian perang dan senjata, mati dengan tidak menaruh sesal; itulah keperwiraan dari Utara yang juga dipegang teguh oleh seorang yang gagah berani."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"